{{!--
  Section: Free Benefit / Why Choose Our Program (L2)
  Lokasi: src/views/partials/components/ui/sections/free_benefit/index.hbs
  
  Slicing presisi 100% sesuai Figma Node 1158:4242 (Why Choose Our Japan Program):
  - Background: #FAFAFA / #F9FAFB
  - Section Header (Node 1158:4244):
    - Title: Montserrat Bold 40px "Why Choose Our Japan Program?"
    - Subtitle: Inter Regular 18px text-[#6B7280] max-w-[760px]
  - Grid: 3 kolom x 2 baris (Node 1158:4247 feature-grid, gap 24px)
  - Card: rounded-[20px] bg-white border border-[#E5E7EB] p-6 (Node 1158:4249)
    - Icon Container: 44x44px rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B]
    - Title: Montserrat Bold 18px text-[#0B1F3B]
    - Description: Inter Regular 14px leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]
  
  Props:
  - category (.name), benefit_category[], lang.
--}}

<section id="benefit" class="w-full bg-[#FAFAFA] py-16 font-inter lg:py-24" data-node-id="1158:4242">
  <div class="page-shell flex flex-col items-center gap-12 lg:gap-14">

    {{!-- section-header (Figma Node 1158:4244) --}}
    <div class="flex max-w-[760px] flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-montserrat text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[40px] font-bold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#0B1F3B]">
        {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}
          Mengapa Memilih <span class="text-[#6EB6E5]">{{#if category.name}}{{category.name}}{{else}}Program Kami{{/if}}</span>?
        {{else}}
          Why Choose <span class="text-[#6EB6E5]">{{#if category.name}}{{category.name}}{{else}}Our Japan Program{{/if}}</span>?
        {{/if}}
      </h2>
      <p class="font-inter text-base sm:text-lg leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280] max-w-[760px]">
        {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}
          Dapatkan keterampilan, kemahiran bahasa, dan pemahaman budaya yang dibutuhkan untuk meraih peluang studi atau karier di Jepang dengan bimbingan komprehensif dari mentor berpengalaman.
        {{else}}
          Gain the skills, language proficiency, and cultural understanding needed to confidently pursue education or employment opportunities in Japan with comprehensive guidance from experienced mentors.
        {{/if}}
      </p>
    </div>

    {{!-- feature-grid (Figma Node 1158:4247) --}}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-7 w-full max-w-[1568px]">
      {{#if benefit_category.length}}
        {{!-- Dynamic database benefit cards --}}
        {{#each benefit_category}}
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[245px]">
            <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B] shrink-0">
              <i class="{{#if this.icon}}{{computeIcon this.icon}}{{else}}fa-solid fa-circle-check{{/if}} text-lg"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-montserrat text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#0B1F3B]">
              {{#if this.title}}{{getByLang this.title ../lang}}{{else}}Feature{{/if}}
            </h3>
            <p class="font-inter text-sm leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]">
              {{#if this.description}}{{getByLang this.description ../lang}}{{else}}{{getByLang this.title ../lang}}{{/if}}
            </p>
          </div>
        {{/each}}
      {{else}}
        {{!-- High Fidelity 6 Features matching Figma Node 1158:4242 --}}
        
        {{!-- Feature 1: Comprehensive Japanese Language Training (Node 1158:4249) --}}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[245px]">
          <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B] shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#0B1F3B]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Pelatihan Bahasa Jepang Komprehensif{{else}}Comprehensive Japanese Language Training{{/if}}
          </h3>
          <p class="font-inter text-sm leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Bangun keterampilan komunikasi bahasa Jepang yang kuat melalui pelajaran terstruktur yang mencakup berbicara, mendengar, membaca, dan menulis untuk penggunaan sehari-hari maupun profesional.{{else}}Build strong Japanese communication skills through structured lessons covering speaking, listening, reading, and writing for everyday and professional use.{{/if}}
          </p>
        </div>

        {{!-- Feature 2: Experienced Instructors (Node 1158:4255) --}}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[245px]">
          <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B] shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-users text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#0B1F3B]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Instruktur Berpengalaman{{else}}Experienced Instructors{{/if}}
          </h3>
          <p class="font-inter text-sm leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Belajar dari mentor berpengalaman yang memberikan wawasan praktis, bimbingan personal, dan metode pengajaran yang efektif di sepanjang perjalanan belajar Anda.{{else}}Learn from experienced mentors who provide practical insights, personalized guidance, and effective teaching methods throughout your learning journey.{{/if}}
          </p>
        </div>

        {{!-- Feature 3: JLPT Preparation (Node 1158:4261) --}}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[245px]">
          <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B] shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-award text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#0B1F3B]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Persiapan Ujian JLPT{{else}}JLPT Preparation{{/if}}
          </h3>
          <p class="font-inter text-sm leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Persiapkan diri untuk JLPT dengan materi belajar komprehensif, latihan ujian, dan strategi teruji untuk membantu Anda meraih level target.{{else}}Prepare for the JLPT with comprehensive study materials, practice tests, and proven strategies to help you achieve your target level.{{/if}}
          </p>
        </div>

        {{!-- Feature 4: Career & Study Support (Node 1158:4268) --}}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[245px]">
          <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B] shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#0B1F3B]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Dukungan Karier & Studi{{else}}Career & Study Support{{/if}}
          </h3>
          <p class="font-inter text-sm leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Dapatkan bimbingan untuk melanjutkan studi, magang, atau peluang karier di Jepang, termasuk persiapan wawancara dan bantuan aplikasi.{{else}}Receive guidance for pursuing study, internship, or career opportunities in Japan, including interview preparation and application assistance.{{/if}}
          </p>
        </div>

        {{!-- Feature 5: Hands-On & Interactive Learning (Node 1158:4274) --}}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[245px]">
          <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B] shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#0B1F3B]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Pembelajaran Praktik & Interaktif{{else}}Hands-On & Interactive Learning{{/if}}
          </h3>
          <p class="font-inter text-sm leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Belajar melalui kegiatan interaktif, percakapan kehidupan nyata, simulasi peran, dan latihan praktis yang membangun rasa percaya diri serta kemampuan komunikasi nyata.{{else}}Learn through interactive activities, real-life conversations, role-playing, and practical exercises that build confidence and real-world communication skills.{{/if}}
          </p>
        </div>

        {{!-- Feature 6: Japanese Culture & Workplace Readiness (Node 1158:4280) --}}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[245px]">
          <div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#6EB6E5]/10 text-[#0B1F3B] shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#0B1F3B]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Budaya Jepang & Kesiapan Kerja{{else}}Japanese Culture & Workplace Readiness{{/if}}
          </h3>
          <p class="font-inter text-sm leading-[160%] text-[#6B7280]">
            {{#if (eq lang 'id')}}Pahami budaya Jepang, etika tempat kerja, dan komunikasi profesional untuk beradaptasi dengan percaya diri saat tinggal dan bekerja di Jepang.{{else}}Understand Japanese culture, workplace etiquette, and professional communication to confidently adapt to life and work in Japan.{{/if}}
          </p>
        </div>

      {{/if}}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
